{c: Verse 1}
[Am] [G] [F],        Labon ko labon pe sajao
[Am] [G] [F],        kya ho tum mujhay ab batao
[E] [F],        tor do khud ko tum
[Am] [G],        banhon me meri banhon me
[F] [G],        meri banhon me meri baanhon me
[Am] [G],        tere ehsaso me bhege lamhato me
[F] [G],        mujhko duba tishnagi si hai
[Am] [G],        teri adaaon se dilkhash khataon se
[F] [G],        in lamhon me zindagi si hai
[Am] [G] [F],        haya ko zara bhool jao
[Am] [G] [F],        meri hi terha pesh aao
[E] [F],        kho bhi do khudko tum
[Am] [G],        raaton me meri raaton me
[F] [G],        meri raaton me meri raanton me
[Am] [G],        tere jazbato me mehki si saanso me
[F] [G],        yeh jo mahek sandali si hai
[Am] [G],        dilki panahon me bikhri si aahon me
[F] [G],        sonay ki khahish jagi si hai
[Am] [G] [F],        chehray se chehra chupao
[Am] [G] [F],        seenay ki dharkan sunao
[E] [F],        dekh lo khudko tum
[G] [F],        ankhon me meri ankhon me
[G] [F],        meri ankhon me meri aankhon me
